{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Declared mutants of the tools' guards for the framework (v8-tool-framework-shell; v8-tool-ui-editor-path-dialog-adopt and -shell-adopt add the dialog and command-line mutants; v8-tool-audio-editor-edit adds the editor's trim, gain, preview, waveform, project and window-guard mutants): ui_editor and audio_editor, owned by the tool line. Run with docs/architecture/plans/time-threads-trace/scripts/run_mutations.py --catalog docs/tools/plans/v8/scripts/framework_mutations.json --build-dir <a tree with GYO_TOOLS=AUTO (ui_editor and audio_editor) and BUILD_TESTING=ON>. A mutant is killed only when its test run fails with the expected message. The framework's own mutants moved to docs/architecture/plans/framework-rework/scripts/framework_mutations.json (v8-framework-guard-ratchet).",
  "mutants": [
    {
      "id": "ui-guard-native-target",
      "what": "ui_editor names the native SDL platform beside the framework's ImGui binding",
      "file": "tools/ui_editor/CMakeLists.txt",
      "find": "        GYO::RenderBackendSDLNative\n    )\n",
      "replace": "        GYO::RenderBackendSDLNative\n        GYO::PlatformSDLNative\n    )\n",
      "command": [
        "{python}",
        "tests/ui_editor/ui_editor_dependency_guard.py"
      ],
      "expect": "names GYO::PlatformSDLNative"
    },
    {
      "id": "ui-dialog-stale-accepted",
      "what": "An answer counts for whatever request is waiting, whatever its tag",
      "file": "tools/ui_editor/src/PathDialog.cpp",
